Chapter: AuthDemo
  cites Net chapter WebServer
  cites Net chapter Accounts

 Minimal server proving the Accounts std-include. auth-serve handles
 /api/auth/register|login|logout|me; this app route is called for every other
 path with the authenticated Account (or None) and greets the user. Run like
 ExplorerServer: framed TCP over the NIC, guest connects to host:9100.

 We say:

  app-route : Maybe Account, Text -> Text
  app-route (who) (path) =
    when who
      is None -> "{\"message\":\"hello, stranger\"}"
      is Just (a) -> "{\"message\":\"welcome back\",\"handle\":" & jstr (a.handle) & ",\"id\":" & show (a.acc-id) & "}"

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    r <- auth-serve (app-route)
    print-line-uni "SHUTDOWN"
  end

